It is a bright sunny morning.
I am standing at my bus stop.
There are many vehicles on the road.
I take the bus from this very stop every day.
But I need to go to a new place today.
So I wait for the BEST bus.
After a while, a red bus arrives.
This is my familiar bus.
The bus stops in front of me.
The doors of the bus open.
I step onto the bus.
I am used to Mumbai's buses now.
Some people are sitting inside the bus.
I hold the bus handrail tightly.
I stand properly.
The bus moves forward.
I need to get to the metro station by this bus.
My journey for today begins.
